{
  "id": "PfPayProcess0001",
  "name": "Payments: Event processor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "fa8079ee-ffb8-4898-abaa-e6c8fa027eea",
      "name": "When called for one event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "seconds",
              "secondsInterval": 10
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "722b3606-0bff-42a7-a0f0-85b053d985c4",
      "name": "Sweep every 10 seconds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT * FROM pay.claim($1, 25);",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.event_id ?? null ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "12f551b2-68ef-4a38-a6ff-c02720446cba",
      "name": "Claim due events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "pgAppsCred000001",
          "name": "Apps DB (Postgres)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT pay.apply($1::bigint) AS r;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.id ] }}",
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "fa79a6a2-478c-4744-aac2-2f8bca22d68d",
      "name": "Apply state transition",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        460,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "pgAppsCred000001",
          "name": "Apps DB (Postgres)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "827558a2-e18b-f9b4-3406-9a3ec99a1954",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.r.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "fulfill",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "fulfill"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "ceec8c05-8f99-74b8-6ee8-2e89acb25d84",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.r.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "retry",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "retry"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 3
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "33cad0d9-1d0d-eb45-f81c-ffa7c6a9e884",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.r.action }}",
                    "rightValue": "complete",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "complete"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1d6b29f5-3c1d-46b1-a997-ef793c2f0ba4",
      "name": "Next step",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        700,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.MOCK_POS_URL }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $json.r.event_id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ order_id: $json.r.order_id, amount_cents: $json.r.amount_cents, currency: $json.r.currency, customer_email: $json.r.customer_email }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 5000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "4be87865-b27c-49e0-af55-ace5ed4aa810",
      "name": "POS: create order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        960,
        -40
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6fac6111-5b5c-1127-f4fa-c35b6eb3c612",
              "leftValue": "={{ [200, 201].includes($json.statusCode) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3d0417a-69ed-4f2a-aa35-227b7d7d4ec0",
      "name": "POS accepted?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT pay.fulfilled($1::bigint, $2, $3) AS r;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $('Apply state transition').item.json.r.inbox_id, $('Apply state transition').item.json.r.order_id, $json.body.pos_order_id ] }}",
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "e81e7a9b-1e20-4fdf-a878-4d7c910c9185",
      "name": "Mark fulfilled",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1420,
        -120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "pgAppsCred000001",
          "name": "Apps DB (Postgres)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT pay.fail($1::bigint, $2) AS r;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $('Apply state transition').item.json.r.inbox_id, $json.r?.outcome ? 'Waiting: ' + $json.r.outcome : 'POS error: ' + ($json.statusCode ?? 'no response') + ' ' + JSON.stringify($json.body ?? $json.error ?? '').slice(0, 300) ] }}",
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "5fa7d061-b60a-445b-a3dc-52ddc2caef7b",
      "name": "Schedule retry or dead-letter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1420,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "pgAppsCred000001",
          "name": "Apps DB (Postgres)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "a0a13a82-149b-c03d-9c0c-bd3cc44210ee",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.r.status === 'dead' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "47046c24-bb20-4cb4-a5bf-55f834ff2ba1",
      "name": "Dead-lettered?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1660,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "e52c10b6-1bca-41fc-a0f4-82fadcfb3661",
      "name": "Page on-call (dead letter)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1900,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT pay.complete($1::bigint, $2) AS r;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.r.inbox_id, $json.r.outcome ] }}",
          "queryBatching": "independently"
        }
      },
      "id": "87362d90-7ac3-4941-ae79-d83e0471840c",
      "name": "Complete event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "pgAppsCred000001",
          "name": "Apps DB (Postgres)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Processor: at-least-once, effectively once\n- Events are claimed with `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` and a 2 minute lease, so several n8n workers never process the same event, and a crashed execution is picked up again after the lease expires.\n- The order state machine lives in `pay.apply()`: duplicates are no-ops, a refund that arrives before the payment is parked and retried (`out_of_order`).\n- The POS call carries `Idempotency-Key = event_id`, so a retry after a timeout cannot create a second POS order.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "8d805f05-e7e9-4f69-a796-287a483e28f4",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Retries and dead letters\nFailures back off exponentially with jitter (30s, 60s, 120s... capped at 1h). After `max_attempts` the event is dead-lettered and a critical alert is raised in `ops.alerts`.\n\nReplace the NoOp with Slack / PagerDuty. Fix the cause, then `POST /webhook/payments/admin/replay`.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "42942e18-dc75-4161-ab7b-8e0c7e1a8232",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1380,
        340
      ]
    }
  ],
